[left][size=5][u]Installation[/u][/size]
<br />1) Back up your "Characters" and "Portraits"﻿ folders from the [u]Stardew Valley/Content[/u]﻿ directory;
<br />2) Download mod archive;
<br />3) Copy folders "Characters" and "Portraits" from archive to [u]Stardew Valley/Content[/u] directory;
<br />
<br />[size=5][u]Uninstallation
<br />[/u][/size]Simply put your backed up files in [u]Stardew Valley/Content[/u]﻿ directory﻿.[/left]
